-- 사회를 성신제T · 조안나T 두 파트로 나누고 조안나T 덱(객관식 49 + 서술형 4)을 넣는다.
-- 기존 카드는 한 장도 고치거나 지우지 않는다. 덱 이름·순서만 바꾼다.
-- 사이트 메뉴(코드)에 social-jo가 들어가기 전까지는 DB에 있어도 화면에 보이지 않는다.
begin;

do $check$
begin
  if exists (select 1 from public.decks where id='social-jo') or exists (select 1 from public.cards where id like 'social-jo-%') then raise exception 'social-jo already exists; review before applying'; end if;
  if not exists (select 1 from public.decks where id='social' and name='사회' and full_name='사회(성신제)' and sort=3) then raise exception 'Deck social changed; review before applying'; end if;
end
$check$;

update public.decks set name='성신제T', full_name='사회(성신제T)' where id='social';
update public.decks set sort=5 where id='english' and sort=4;
update public.decks set sort=6 where id='biology-jo' and sort=5;
update public.decks set sort=7 where id='biology-park' and sort=6;
update public.decks set sort=8 where id='astronomy-hwang' and sort=7;
update public.decks set sort=9 where id='astronomy-jeon' and sort=8;
update public.decks set sort=10 where id='physics-ii' and sort=9;


do $verify$
begin
  if (select count(*) from public.cards where deck_id='social-jo') <> 53 then raise exception 'social-jo card count mismatch'; end if;
  if (select count(*) from public.decks) <> 11 then raise exception 'deck count mismatch'; end if;
  if (select string_agg(id, ',' order by sort) from public.decks) <> 'korean-newyork,korean-grammar,korean-classic,social,social-jo,english,biology-jo,biology-park,astronomy-hwang,astronomy-jeon,physics-ii' then raise exception 'deck order mismatch'; end if;
end
$verify$;

commit;

-- Verify: 49 choice, 4 written
select kind, count(*) from public.cards where deck_id='social-jo' group by kind;
